@startuml F2.1-D03-reemitir-certificado
title F2.1-D03 — Reemitir certificado
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Egresso" as Egresso
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "CertificateController" as Ctrl
participant "ReissueCertificateUC" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres
participant "MinIO" as MinIO

Egresso -> WebApp: Reemitir PDF
WebApp -> Ctrl: reemitir
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: SELECT certificate\n(owner = alumniId)
Postgres --> UC: storage_key EMITIDO
UC -> MinIO: URL GET\ndo PDF existente
MinIO --> UC: URL
UC --> Ctrl: URL
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200

note right of UC
  Sem novo certificado
  Mesmo hash / ED25519
end note

WebApp -> MinIO: GET PDF
MinIO --> Egresso: PDF original

@enduml
